  "sourceTitle": "Quick Pickled Shallots",
  "sourceText": "Quick Pickled Shallots\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 11:37pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 large shallot\n1/4 cup red wine vinegar\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 tablespoon water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients into a non-reactive dish. 2 Cover with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least an hour.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis recipe is part of a larger recipe for Ahi Tuna Sliders from the book EAT & DRINK in the Northwest.",
